                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 4.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Mukhara Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe khwikela nga mwakhola ne muli Masa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube barekerefu mu khuria kamalaka ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe niko aamuelesia enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khola kaali kamaluungi lundi kamalayi, ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nio mube bulayi, nio mwingisie ne khubukula kamaloba kamalayi ke kumukabwa. Kali kamaloba niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aasuubisia khuelesia bakuuka benywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulaoona basiku benywe baalimo boosi, basiku baali ebweeni wenywe nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne asuubisia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu siise sisiicha babaana benywe balimureeba enywe bali, ‘Sifuno sie kamalaka kano sili siina?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baboolele muli, ‘Efwe khwaba banasioobi bo mwami Farao owe Misiri. Ne kakhali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhureesia efwe khubirira mu bunyali bwewe bukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhola kamaya nende bie khuukia biboofu lundi biriisia mu sibala sia Misiri ne khu Farao ne enju yewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhurusia efwe khukhwama Misiri khukhureera efwe ano ne khukhuelesia efwe sibala sino, nga ne aaba ne aasuubisia bakuuka befwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe aakhulaka efwe khurie kamalaka kano koosi ne khumuria niye. Khwaaba ne khukhola khurio, khuliba bulayi buli lwosi nio achiililile khu khuliinda efwe nga luno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwaaba ne khuria buli sisiindu mu burekeerefu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe nga aakhulaka, aba silaba sisiindu sie buluungi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sisiindu sie buluungi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "khwaaba ne khuria buli siindu mu burekeerefu . . . ne nafwe, namwe sisiindu sie buluungi khwifwe nisio khukhola sili khuloonda buli siindu nisio Wele akhuboolela efwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
